Acts 11:1 , Peter, being accused for going in to the Gentiles
Acts 11:5 , makes his defence;
Acts 11:18 , which is accepted;
Acts 11:19 , The gospel being spread in Phenice, and Cyprus, and Antioch, Barnabas is sent to confirm them;
Acts 11:26 , The disciples there are first called Christians;
Acts 11:27 , They send relief to the brethren in Judea in time of famine.
